        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/lego-batman-(1).jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Batman, you've probably heard of him. This masked hero of the night has been protecting Gotham City across films, TV series, comic books and games for over 80 years. Many actors have portrayed Batman since his comic book-conception, with the likes of Christian Bale, Ben Affleck, Michael Keaton, and Robert Pattinson all taking on the role in films (and, who can forget George Clooney's nipple suit for his turn as Batman). In the games, meanwhile, we have seen names <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/troy-baker-ai-art-doesnt-innovate-interview\">like Troy Baker</a> and Will Arnett voicing the Caped Crusader. Of course, there is also late, great Kevin Conroy, who is seen by many as the definitive take on both Batman and Bruce Wayne.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/lego-batman-legacy-of-the-dark-knight-shai-matheson-kevin-conroy\">Read more</a></p>",
